{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんこんにちは〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒くなりましたね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お鍋食べたり、あったかい上着を着たりして\nお互いかぜひかないように過ごしましょう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あったかくしなきゃいけないのに、今、アイスが食べたい…。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハマっているアイスがあって、最近1日1個食べてます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハマったらとことん食べるタイプです。\nさっきひなのと、このことについて話してた。\n\"それずっと食べてるね\" って。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日のオンラインミート&グリートありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハロウィンということで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "探偵になってみた。\nなんか、謎解きが上手になれたような気分＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobYtq7My.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobsKklu7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202510/mobrkuzGl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うさぎちゃんにもなってみた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11月1日から「乃木坂46Mail」「乃木坂46メッセージ」が始まります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい…！楽しみ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださり、ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}